WEBVTT

00:22:27.076 --> 00:22:30.236
What gives you hope about the future?

00:22:30.276 --> 00:22:34.516
Are there treatments or other things
coming down the pipeline

00:22:34.516 --> 00:22:35.916
that you're excited about?

00:22:36.516 --> 00:22:42.396
AF: Well, science is an absolutely
phenomenal discipline.

00:22:43.956 --> 00:22:45.636
It's discovery.

00:22:45.636 --> 00:22:46.876
It's ...

00:22:48.396 --> 00:22:50.076
brand new knowledge.

00:22:51.196 --> 00:22:53.396
Pushing back the frontiers of knowledge

00:22:53.396 --> 00:22:56.756
that we would not have imagined
we would be in.

00:22:56.796 --> 00:22:59.076
If you look at medicine and science,

00:22:59.116 --> 00:23:02.676
how it's changed in a very,
very positive way